@startuml use-case-diagram
' 武汉地铁模拟运行系统 —— 用例图
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #FEFEFE
    BorderColor #333333
}

actor "乘客" as Passenger

rectangle "武汉地铁模拟运行系统" {
    usecase "查询站点线路信息" as UC_StationLines
    usecase "查询线路站点信息" as UC_LineStations
    usecase "查询中转站" as UC_Transfers
    usecase "查询周边站点" as UC_Nearby
    usecase "查询最短路线" as UC_Shortest
    usecase "查询合理乘车路线" as UC_Reasonable
    usecase "查看分段乘车指引" as UC_Guide
    usecase "计算票价" as UC_Fare
    usecase "计算单程票价" as UC_FareSingle
    usecase "计算武汉通票价" as UC_FareWuhanTong
    usecase "计算定期票票价" as UC_FarePass
}

Passenger --> UC_StationLines
Passenger --> UC_LineStations
Passenger --> UC_Transfers
Passenger --> UC_Nearby
Passenger --> UC_Shortest
Passenger --> UC_Reasonable
Passenger --> UC_Fare

UC_Reasonable ..> UC_Shortest : <<include>>
UC_Guide ..> UC_Reasonable : <<extend>>
UC_Fare ..> UC_Reasonable : <<extend>>
UC_FareSingle --|> UC_Fare
UC_FareWuhanTong --|> UC_Fare
UC_FarePass --|> UC_Fare

note bottom of UC_Reasonable
  合理路线：无环；里程 ≤ 最短 × 1.5；
  换乘 ≤ 最少换乘 + 2；删除被全面占优的路线；
  按里程升序，最多 10 条
end note

note bottom of UC_Fare
  票价规则来源：武汉地铁集团官网
  单程票按里程分段计价；武汉通 9 折；
  定期票（1/3/7 日）有效期内不限次
end note

' 线路数据 subway.txt 在系统启动时加载，属于前置条件，不作为参与者绘制
@enduml